# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "AKC offers several useful functions, such as:\n"
msgstr "AKC bietet mehrere nützliche Funktionen, darunter:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Encryption and decryption** to enable **confidentiality** of "
"communications.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Verschlüsselung und Entschlüsselung** zur Gewährleistung der "
"**Vertraulichkeit** der Kommunikation.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Digital signatures** to ensure **authenticity**, **integrity**, and **non-"
"repudiation**.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Digitale Signaturen** zur Sicherstellung von **Authentizität**, "
"**Integrität** und **Non-Repudiation**.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Secure key exchange** to facilitate subsequent use of symmetric "
"cryptosystems.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sicherer Schlüsselaustausch** zur Ermöglichung der anschließenden Nutzung "
"symmetrischer Kryptosysteme.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In modern applications, AKC is primarily used for digital signatures and "
"secure key exchange. In this lesson, we introduce these two key functions, "
"and then we discuss several variations of cryptographic protocols for these "
"functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"In modernen Anwendungen wird AKC hauptsächlich für digitale Signaturen und "
"den sicheren Schlüsselaustausch eingesetzt. In dieser Lektion stellen wir "
"diese beiden Schlüsselfunktionen vor und erörtern anschließend verschiedene "
"Varianten kryptografischer Protokolle für diese Funktionen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Key exchange with asymmetric key cryptography {#key-exchange-with-"
"asymmetric-key-cryptography}"
msgstr ""
"Schlüsselaustausch mit asymmetrischer Schlüsselkryptografie {#key-exchange-"
"with-asymmetric-key-cryptography}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One of the fundamental problems in cryptography is securely [exchanging "
"keys](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Key_exchange&oldid=1134576107)."
" For example, if two parties want to use symmetric encryption, both parties "
"need the same key to encrypt and decrypt messages. But how do they securely "
"exchange the key? Asymmetric key cryptography addresses this through "
"interactive and non-interactive key exchange mechanisms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eines der grundlegenden Probleme in der Kryptografie ist der sichere "
"[Schlüsselaustausch](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Key_exchange&oldid=1134576107)."
" Wenn zwei Parteien zum Beispiel symmetrische Verschlüsselung verwenden "
"möchten, benötigen beide denselben Schlüssel zum Ver- und Entschlüsseln von "
"Nachrichten. Aber wie tauschen sie den Schlüssel sicher aus? Die "
"asymmetrische Schlüsselkryptografie löst dies durch interaktive und nicht-"
"interaktive Schlüsselaustauschmechanismen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Interactive key exchange {#interactive-key-exchange}"
msgstr "Interaktiver Schlüsselaustausch {#interactive-key-exchange}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An interactive *key exchange protocol* refers to a method where two parties "
"collaborate to create a *shared secret* key over an insecure communication "
"channel. This shared secret key can then be used for symmetric encryption "
"and decryption tasks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ein interaktives *Schlüsselaustauchprotokoll* bezeichnet eine Methode, bei "
"der zwei Parteien zusammenarbeiten, um über einen unsicheren "
"Kommunikationskanal einen *gemeinsamen geheimen* Schlüssel zu erstellen. "
"Dieser gemeinsame geheime Schlüssel kann dann für symmetrische Ver- und "
"Entschlüsselungsaufgaben verwendet werden.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The most well known among such protocols is the [Diffie-Hellman "
"algorithm](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman_key_exchange&oldid=1163912552)"
" (DH), which was devised specifically to facilitate key exchange. In this "
"protocol, each party generates a pair of keys (public and private) and "
"broadcasts their public key. Then each party uses their own private key and "
"the other party's public key to generate a shared secret key. DH employs the"
" principles of modular arithmetic to ensure both parties end up with the "
"same shared secret even though each party has access only to the other "
"party's public key.\n"
msgstr ""
"Das bekannteste dieser Protokolle ist der [Diffie-Hellman-"
"Algorithmus](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman_key_exchange&oldid=1163912552)"
" (DH), der speziell für den Schlüsselaustausch entwickelt wurde. Bei diesem "
"Protokoll erzeugt jede Partei ein Schlüsselpaar (öffentlich und privat) und "
"veröffentlicht ihren öffentlichen Schlüssel. Anschließend verwendet jede "
"Partei ihren eigenen privaten Schlüssel und den öffentlichen Schlüssel der "
"anderen Partei, um einen gemeinsamen geheimen Schlüssel zu erzeugen. DH "
"nutzt die Prinzipien der modularen Arithmetik, um sicherzustellen, dass "
"beide Parteien am Ende denselben gemeinsamen Schlüssel erhalten, obwohl jede"
" Partei nur Zugang zum öffentlichen Schlüssel der anderen hat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Modern cryptosystems based on [elliptic curve "
"cryptography](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_cryptography&oldid=1160709993) (ECC) extend this concept with the "
"[elliptic curve Diffie-"
"Hellman)](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman&oldid=1160050860) (ECDH) key exchange. ECDH "
"works similarly to DH but utilizes the properties of elliptic curves, "
"resulting in a more secure and efficient system.\n"
msgstr ""
"Moderne Kryptosysteme auf Basis der [Elliptische-Kurven-"
"Kryptografie](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_cryptography&oldid=1160709993) (ECC) erweitern dieses Konzept mit dem "
"[Elliptic Curve Diffie-"
"Hellman](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman&oldid=1160050860) (ECDH) Schlüsselaustausch. "
"ECDH funktioniert ähnlich wie DH, nutzt jedoch die Eigenschaften "
"elliptischer Kurven, was zu einem sichereren und effizienteren System "
"führt.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Figure 2. Key Exchange Protocol](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-"
"cryptography/asymmetric-key-cryptography/kep_akc.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Abbildung 2. Schlüsselaustauchprotokoll](/learning/images/courses/quantum-"
"safe-cryptography/asymmetric-key-cryptography/kep_akc.svg)\n"

